# Build context of the Dockerfile: the workspace root without what the image never needs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
openspec
dashboard-ce/tools
# Their manifests keep the workspace consistent with the lockfile.
!dashboard-ce/tools/*/package.json
PLAN.md
# Development settings, personal ones included, never reach the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/dev.env
